y you'll live a little longer?<br><br></li><li><strong>Play minigames</strong>. Cut wood, mine for gold, trade on a market or win the princess in dice. Your skill can save your life.</li></ul><br><br>How will your story end?","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"fca2e50cdee2c6c5dac62d65b8bfafaa6a22bdc8.jpg","localized_name":"Death 1","name":"Death 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1146170/fca2e50cdee2c6c5dac62d65b8bfafaa6a22bdc8.jpg"},{"icon":"361f898a73560746852226e9c0f7bbb07b2ef3d0.jpg","localized_name":"Death 2","name":"Death 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1146170/361f898a73560746852226e9c0f7bbb07b2ef3d0.jpg"},{"icon":"1ff790f607344c43f525fe91dc6de8c778f5ca58.jpg","localized_name":"Death 3","name":"Death 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1146170/1ff790f607344c43f525fe91dc6de8c778f5ca58.jpg"},{"icon":"7086984d0a0f5a86ceb215ebc80b25ea238bd257.jpg","localized_name":"Death 4","name":"Death 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1146170/7086984d0a0f5a86ceb215ebc80b25ea238bd257.jpg"},{"icon":"0ce6250cac626df578dd3bc0a0ea881c178eb68c.jpg","localized_name":"Death 5","name":"Death 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1146170/0ce6250cac626df578dd3bc0a0ea881c178eb68c.jpg"},{"icon":"80b4c038c785366582413a7245cdc8c330b622df.jpg","localized_name":"Death 6","name":"Death 6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1146170/80b4c038c785366582413a7245cdc8c330b622df.jpg"},{"icon":"4d28fa0ed55e2b47e82622735742901086035ad0.jpg","localized_name":"Death 7","name":"Death 7","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1146170/4d28fa0ed55e2b47e82622735742901086035ad0.jpg"},{"icon":"3df5b9134179b1b0452618237278242c2e363da7.jpg","localized_name":"Death 8","name":"Death 8","path":"https://cdn.akamai.